#N canvas 0 50 1000 600 10;
#X text 10 5 13_partials: additive drone organ \, 16 partials. See docs/PARTIALS.md and patches/13_partials_README.md.;
#X text 10 20 Pitch = note (click = C2). Start = which partials. Size = stretch. Window = tilt. Overlap = drift. Reset = deal. Freeze = hold.;
